	II
	[m0][p]v prep[/p]
	[m1][trn]1 существовать (где-л. или когда-л.):[/trn]
	\[L9 + in\] [ex]♦ The photographs are in the bottom drawer.
	There are cows in that field, let's go another way.
	That was in the last century, when life was much slower.[/ex]
	→ be out of (1), etc., come into (1), get into (1), go into (1), keep in (1), remain in2 (1), stay in2 (1), stick in2 (6), stop in2 (1)
	[m1][trn]2 работать или заниматься каким-л. делом:[/trn]
	\[L9 + in\] [ex]♦ Mary's father did not want her to marry Jim because he was in trade. Two of his brothers are in printing, the other in law.[/ex]
