	[m1][trn]20 [b]be out of the picture[/b] [p]not fml[/p] быть не в курсе событий:[/trn]
	[ex]♦ Please tell те what you're doing, I seem to be out of the picture.[/ex] → be in2 (26), put in2 (22)
	[m1][trn]21 [b]be out of play[/b] [i](о мяче)[/i] быть вне игры:[/trn]
