	[m1][trn]26 be out of (someone's) reach быть недосягаемым, недостижимым:[/trn]
	[ex]♦ The boy climbed the tree, but the apples were still out of (his) reach. You might be employed as a salesman, but the director's job is out of your reach. A beautiful girl like that is sure to be out of reach.[/ex]
	[m1][trn]27 [b]be out of the running[/b] не иметь шанеов на успех или выигрыш:[/trn]
