	[m1][trn]10 высказывать (мнение и т. п.):[/trn]
	\[[com]T1 (usu. simple tenses)[/com]\] [ex]♦ She was so shocked that she could hardly bring out a word.[/ex]
	[m1][trn]11 обнаружить, раскрыть:[/trn]
	\[T1\] [ex]♦ It did not take the police long to bring out the truth. [/ex]→ let out (5), etc.
	
