bring up
	[p]v adv[/p]
	[m1][trn]1 поднимать, относить наверх; доводить до верхнего уровня:[/trn]
	\[T1 + UP (to)\] [ex]♦ When the doctor arrives, bring him up. Mother says would you please bring up the tea things. The road will bring you up to the top of the cliff.[/ex]
	→ come up (2), go up1 (1), send up1 (1), take up (3)
	[m1][trn]2 esp. [p]BrE[/p] воспитывать, растить (детей):[/trn]
