	[m1][trn]6 [p]naut[/p] остановить(ся):[/trn]
	\[[com]T1b (usu simple tenses)[/com]\] [ex]♦ The captain was able to bring the ship up just before it hit the little boat.[/ex]
	\[IØ (simple tenses)\] [ex]♦ The ship brought up just before it hit the little boat.[/ex] → bring to2 (2), come to (4), heave to
	[m1][trn]7 резко остановить (кого-л.):[/trn]
	\[[com]T1 (usu. pass.) [/com]\] [ex]♦ John was about to enter the room when he was brought up (short) by a note on the door.[/ex]
	[m1][trn]8 пополнять (кем-л.):[/trn]
