	[m1][trn]2 падать:
	\[IØ + DOWN\] [ex]♦ Several trees came down in last night's storm. The child, running too fast, came down and hurt his knee. When the hunters fired, three of the deer came down. [/ex]
	→ bring down (2), get down (5), go down1 (5), send down (4), shoot down (1)
	[m1][trn]3 быть выведенным из строя, быть разрушенным:[/trn]
