	→ bring down (2), go down1 (5), pull down (3), send down (4), shoot down (1), take down (3)
	[m1][trn]4 [i](о самолёте)[/i] приземляться, делать посадку:[/trn]
	\[IØ + DOWN\] [ex]♦ The plane came down safely in spite of the mist.[/ex]
	[m1][trn]5 падать, уменьшаться, снижаться:[/trn]
	\[IØ\] [ex]♦ The price came down. My weight has come down again.[/ex] → go down1 (6), etc., go up (3) 
