	[m1][trn]8 опуститься, деградировать:[/trn]
	\[IØ\] [ex]♦ He has come down in my opinion.[/ex] → come up (12), go down1 (16), go up1 (12)
	[m1][trn]9 сводиться (к чему-л.):[/trn]
	\[IØ (to) (simple tenses)) [ex]♦ When it all comes down, there isnt much in his story. The whole matter comes down to a power struggle between the trade union and the directors.[/ex]
