	[m1][trn]4 неохотно тратить (деньги):[/trn]
	\[[com]T1 (no pass., usu. simple tenses)[/com]\] [ex]♦ I shall have to cut into my savings to pay for the holiday. I don't want to cut into a £10 note if I can help it.[/ex]
	→ break into (6)
	
cut loose
	[p]v adj[/p]
	[m1][trn]1 высвобождать (что-л., кого-л. или животное), отвязывать:[/trn]
