	\[[com]IØ (simple tenses)[/com]\] [ex]♦ When Jim gets drunk, he always cuts loose.[/ex]
	
cut off
	[p]v adv[/p]
	[m1][trn]1 обрезать, отрезать, отрубать, отсекать:[/trn]
	\[Х9 + OFF) [ex]♦ King Charles had his head cut off. Show the child how to cut the top off before he eats his egg.[/ex]
	→ slice off, snip off, strike off (1), swish off
	[m1][trn]2 перебивать (кого-л. или что-л.), прерывать:[/trn]
