	[m1][trn]6 изолировать (кого-л.), уединяться:[/trn]
	\[[com]T1 (from) (usu. simple tenses)[/com]\] [ex]♦ Why did the old woman cut herself off from society like that? Was there an unhappy story in her youth?[/ex]
	[m1][trn]7 лишать (кого-л.) денежной поддержки, особ. наследства, особ. во фразе cut someone off without a penny:[/trn]
	\[[com]T1 (usu. simple tenses)[/com]\] [ex]♦ I'll cut you off without a penny.[/ex]
	→ cut out (5)
	[m1][trn]8 убить (кого-л.):[/trn]
	\[T1 (usu. pass.)\] [ex]♦ The soldier was cut off in his youth.[/ex] → cut down (4) 
	[m1][trn]9 [p]infml[/p] быстро идти, сходить, сбегать:[/trn]
