	\[IØ\] [ex]♦ Our army forced the enemy to fall back. The crowd fell back to let the fire engine through.[/ex]
	[m1][trn]4 отставать; терять достигнутые позиции; терять темп; понижаться:[/trn]
	\[IØ\] [ex]♦ We thought the horse would win, but he fell back halfway through the race. This record has fallen back to third place in the popularity lists. Don't fall back now, just when you're doing so well. Production has fallen back in the last few months. Prices will never fall back.[/ex] → lag behind (1), etc.
	
