	\[[com]L1 (simple tenses) [/com]\] [ex]♦ In spite of her family's opinion, she fetched up the winner. Who would have guessed that he would fetch up as director of the firm?[/ex]
	\[[com]L7 (simple tenses)[/com]\] [ex]♦ After making his fortune, he fetched up poor when he died. [/ex]
	→ end up (1), finish up (2), land up (3), wind up (6)
