	\[[com]IØ (for) (usu. continuous tenses)[/com]\] [ex]♦ Well, well, look how time's getting along! We really must be going! Grandfather is getting along and doesn't see too well any more. It's getting along for midnight, let's go to bed.[/ex]
	→ get on1 (4), get on for, go on1 (14), go on for
	[m1][trn]5 пережить, продержаться; обходиться:[/trn]
