	→ get by1 (2), etc.
	[m1][trn]6 продвигаться, делать успехи; справляться с делом:[/trn]
	\[L9 (with.)) [ex]♦ How is your work getting along? It's getting along nicely, thank you. How is Tom getting along with his new book? [/ex]
	→ bring on (3), etc.
