	[m1][trn]8 get along (with you) [p]infml[/p] я тебе не верю!, иди ты!, да ну тебя!:[/trn]
	\[[com] imper.[/com]\] [ex]♦ Oh, get along with you! Do you think I'd believe a story like that? Get along! Don't be silly! [/ex]→ come on' (10). etc.
	
