	\[[com]usu. simple tenses[/com]\] [ex]♦ I'll take the children to the park for the afternoon, that'll get them out of your hair for a few hours.[/ex]
	[m1][trn]27 get someone/something out of one's head/mind забывать кого-л. или что-л.; выбросить из головы:[/trn]
