	[m1][trn]28 get out of it! [p] sl[/p] не говори глупости!, кончай!, хватит!:[/trn]
	\[[com] imper. [/com]\] [ex]♦ Get out of it! You can't expect me to believe that![/ex]
	[m1][trn]29 get out of line плохо вести себя; неправильно понимать:[/trn] 
	[ex]♦ The teacher had to watch the children all the time, to see that none of them got out of line.[/ex] → be out of (16), etc.
