	\[[com]X9 + UNDER (usu. simple tenses)[/com]\] [ex]♦ The coin has rolled beneath the piano, and I can't get my hand under, so well have to leave it there.[/ex]
	[m1][trn]2 взять под контроль (что-л.), подчинить (кого-л.):[/trn]
