	[m0][p]v prep[/p]
	[m1][trn]1 пролезать (подо что-л., под чем-л.); просовывать:[/trn]
	\[[com]L9 + under (often simple tenses)[/com]\] [ex]♦ The rabbits have got under the fence again, and are eating all the crops![/ex]
	\[[com]X9 + under (usu. simple tenses)[/com]\] [ex]♦ I can't get the cleaner under these chairs, so will you help me move them?[/ex]
	[m1][trn]2 get under control установить контроль над (чем-л. или кем-л.):[/trn]
