	\[X9 + within (often simple tenses)\] [ex]♦ Shops have been ordered to get their price increases within the limits set by the new law.[/ex] → fall within (2), etc.
	[m1][trn]3 get within earshot (of) быть в пределах слышимости:[/trn]
	[ex]♦ If you can get within earshot of the enemy, you might hear some of his secret plans.[/ex] → come within (3), etc.
	[m1][trn]4 get within range (of) быть в пределах досягаемости; держать на расстоянии выстрела:[/trn] 
	[ex]♦ Don't get within range of their big guns; surround the camp from a distance. I've got the enemy ship within range, shall I fire?[/ex]
