	\[[com]T1 (no pass.)[/com]\] [ex]♦ Hearing the story, the old man went off into loud laughter. When she saw the body of her son, the mother went off into a dead faint.[/ex]
	
go off with
	[p]v adv[/p]
	[m0][p]v prep[/p]
	[m1][trn]1 уходить, уезжать (с чем-л. или кем-л.):[/trn]
	\[L9 + OFF + with (usu. simple tenses)\] [ex]♦ I saw her going off with her mother for a holiday. [/ex]→ go away (1), etc.
