	[m1][trn]3 храниться на верхней полке и т. п.:[/trn]
	\[[com]L9 + on (simple tenses)[/com]\] [ex]♦ The big meat dish goes on the highest shelf.[/ex]
	[m1][trn]4 приступать (к работе и т. п.):[/trn]
	\[[com]Т1 (no pass.)[/com]\] [ex]♦ I go on duty in half an hour.[/ex]
