go around
	I
	[p]v adv[/p]
	[m1][trn]1 объезжать, обходить, ходить, гулять; заходить (к кому-л.):[/trn]
	\[L9 + ROUND (to)\] [ex]♦ We had to go round the long way because the bridge was destroyed. There's plenty of room for people to go round. Go round to Mrs Page next door and borrow some tea.[/ex] → bring over (1), etc., get about1 (1)
	[m1][trn]2 [i] (о новостях, болезни и т. п.)[/i] распространяться:[/trn] 
