	\[IØ (usu. simple tenses)\] [ex]♦ Has the sale of the house gone through yet? Did your business deal go through?[/ex] → put across1 (3), put through1 (1), railroad through, ram through, take through1 (2)
	[m1][trn]4 протереться, износиться до дыр:[/trn]
	\[IØ\] [ex]♦ The bottom of the bucket has gone through. The seat of the boy's trousers has gone through again![/ex] → wear through
	II
	[m0][p]v prep[/p]
