have off
	[p]v adv[/p]
	[m1][trn]1 удалить, отрезать, отхватить, унести:[/trn]
	\[Х9 + OFF (simple tenses)) [ex]♦ Mind that sharp knife, it could have your fingers off! If the wind blows any harder, it'll have the roof off! [/ex]→ take off1 (1), etc.
	[m1][trn]2 снять (какой-л. предмет одежды):[/trn]
	\[[com]Х9 + OFF (simple tenses)[/com]\] [ex]♦ It is customary in this country for men to have their hats off at a funeral. It was so hot that the road workers had their shirts off.[/ex]
