	\[T1b (usu. continuous tenses) \] [ex]♦ I know you're only joking, you're having me on again![/ex] → put on1 (12)
		
have on
have upon
	[m0][p]v prep[/p]
	[m1][trn]1 иметь с собой, при себе:[/trn]
