	\[T1\] [ex]♦ The searchers at last picked up a signal from the crashed plane. This powerful radio can pick up stations from halfway round the world. These new electric buses pick up their power from overhead wires. In a record player, a special instrument in the arm holding the needle picks up patterns of movement from the shape of the cuts in the surface of the record, and changes them into sound,[/ex] 
