	[p]v adv[/p]
	[m1][trn]1 отодвинуть; отложить назад; прижать уши:[/trn]
	\[Х9 + BACK\] [ex]♦ Put your collar back, it's sticking out. Putting back some loose hairs, she put on her hat. Why don't you put your chair back a little to get a better view? Mind that dog when he puts his ears back, it means he's angry.[/ex]
	→ lay back, put forward (1), set back (1), set forward (1)
