	→ be back (3), bring back (1), get back (5), place back, put down (1), send back, take back (1)
	[m1][trn]3 вернуться в прежний вес, размер одежды и т. п.:[/trn]
	\[T1\] [ex]♦ You'll soon put back all the weight that you lost if you start eating cakes again. It didn't take long to put back all those unwanted inches.[/ex] → put on1 (5), take off1 (12)
