	[m1][trn]8 передвигать (стрелки часов) назад:[/trn]
	\[Т1\] [ex]♦ In the autumn we usually put the clocks back one hour. My watch was fast so I put it back three minutes.[/ex]	→ go back (7), put ahead (3), put forward (6), put on1 (8), set ahead (3), set back (5), set forward (6)
