	\[T1bl [ex]♦ It's time to put our differences by and work together for a common purpose.[/ex] → lay aside (3), etc.
	[m1][trn]4 откладывать (деньги):[/trn]
	\[T1b\] [ex]♦ I have a little money put by for a rainy day ([/ex] a time when money will be needed). → lay aside (4), etc.
	[m1][trn]5 откладывать (товар) для постоянного покупателя:[/trn]
