put down as
	[p]v adv[/p]
	[m0][p]v prep[/p]
	[m1][trn]1 считать (что-л. или кого-л. чем-л. или кем-л.):[/trn]
	\[T1\] [ex]♦ You can put the telephone bill down as a business cost. I see that you're put down as a former police officer; why do you want this job? I'm sorry, I'd put you down as belonging to the other group.[/ex] → set down as (1)
	[m1][trn]2 считать кого-л. кем-л.:[/trn]
