put in
	I
	[p]v adv[/p]
	[m1][trn]1 ставить, класть, помещать, совать (что-л. или кого-л.) внутрь чего-л.:[/trn]
	\[Х9 + IN\] [ex]♦ Put your hand in and see what's in the box. The room is crowded already; I hope you're not going to try to put any more furniture in. We can't put any more people in, the bus is full. I'll just put my head in and see if there's anyone here that / know.[/ex]
	→ fit in1 (1), get in1 (1), go in1 (2), poke in1 (1), stick in1 (1)
	[m1][trn]2 сажать (растения):[/trn]
