	[m1][trn]3 добавлять, вставлять (что-л. в написанное):[/trn]
	\[Х9 + IN\] [ex]♦ At the last moment, Tom decided to put in a new character, to make the story seem more likely. Don't forget to put in your full name and address. In his letters, he always puts in some amusing remarks about his neighbours' activities. There is no room to put in a single additional word.[/ex] 
	\[T5 + IN\] [ex]♦ Have you put in that you were away that day? [/ex]
