	\[T1\] [ex]♦ May I put in a word or two?[/ex]
	→ chuck in (4), chuck out (6), fling in1 (4), fling off (7), fling out (7), throw in1 (4), throw off1 (8), throw out (7), toss in1 (3), toss off (2), toss out (6)
	[m1][trn]5 [p] (о судне)[/p] заходить в порт:[/trn]
