	[m1][trn]11 записываться для участия в соревнованиях и т. п., включать в список и т. п.:[/trn]
	\[[com]Т1 (for) (often simple tenses)[/com]\] [ex]♦ Have you put yourself in for the competition? How many of your runners are you putting in (for the race) ? The examination is difficult, and I refuse to put in any student who is not ready.[/ex]
	→ enter for, etc.
