	[m1][trn]10 put someone in awe (of) внушать (кому-л.благоговение, страх и т.п.):[/trn] 
	[ex]♦ A service of worship should put you in awe of God's greatness.[/ex]
	[m1][trn]11 put one's confidence/faith/trust in доверять, верить (кому-л.), надеяться на (кого-л., что-л.):[/trn] 
	[ex]♦ It's not safe to put too much confidence in your ability to pass the examination without working hard. We all put our faith in the team to win this important game. Put your trust in the lard, and all will be well.[/ex]
	→ pin on2 (4), etc.
	[m1][trn]12 put someone in contact/touch with связывать кого-л. с кем-л.:[/trn] 
