	[m1][trn]16 put (one's) heart and soul into [p]not fml[/p] вкладывать всю душу во (что-л.):[/trn] 
	[ex]♦ Every singer was putting her heart and soul into the music, and the effect was wonderful.[/ex]
	[m1][trn]17 put an idea/notion/thought into someone's head [p]not fml[/p] внушать мысль, идею и т. п. кому-л.:[/trn] 
