	[m1][trn]25 put something on the map [p]not fml[/p] прославить, сделать известным, знаменитым и т. п.:[/trn]
	[ex]♦ The big popular music concert has succeeded in putting the small village on the map; everyone has now heard of it. When even greater efforts next year, we should be able to put the firm on the map.[/ex] be on2 (20)
	[m1][trn]26 put something on the market выпускать в продажу, продавать что-л.:[/trn] 
