	[m1][trn]9 put someone out of work выставить за дверь, лишить работы:[/trn]
	\[[com] often simple tenses[/com]\] [ex]♦ The serious fire at the bicycle factory has put 2,000 men and women out of work.[/ex] → throw out (18).
	
put over
	I
	[p]v adv[/p]
	[m1][trn]1 посылать (лошадь) через барьер; перекидывать (что-л. через что-л.):[/trn]
	\[Х9 + OVER[ex]♦ I At the third attempt, she put her horse over, and won the jumping competition. If you can't get your bag under the fence, you'll have to put it over.[/ex]
