	[m1][trn]3 [p]not fml[/p] откладывать (что-л.):[/trn]
	\[T1\] [ex]♦ We shall have to put the garden party over until the weather is fine.[/ex] → put off1 (4), etc.
	[m1][trn]4 [p] (о судне)[/p] класть руль на борт:[/trn]
	\[IØ\] [ex]♦ There's a sailing boat coming towards us, you'd better put over to give her room.[/ex]
	II
	[m0][p]v prep[/p]
	[m1][trn]1 посылать (лошадь) через барьер и т. п.; накрывать (что-л. или кого-л.) сверху (чем-л.):[/trn]
	\[Х9 + over\] The girl rider had great difficulty in putting her nervous horse over the fence. Put a warm cover over the sleeping child.[/ex] → pull over2 (1). etc.
