	\[D1\] [ex]♦ Anyone who opposes the king will be put to death. This gas will put you to sleep during the operation. The whole enemy army was put to flight. I don't want to put you to any trouble. We put the whole family to work on building the boathouse.[/ex] → go to (8, 10)
