	\[[com]T1 + to (often simple tenses)[/ex][/com]\] [ex]♦ Use this special oil to reduce the thick paint to a liquid thin enough to spread easily. Most Englich vowel sounds which are not given weight in speech become reduced to a rather formless central vowel.[/ex]
	[m1][trn]9 ослаблять, подрывать здоровье:[/trn]
