	\[IØ\] [ex]♦ How she does run on! The teacher ran on and on about good behaviour, as usual.[/ex] → be off (9), be on about, go on1 (7), keep on (8)
	[m1][trn]2 (о [ex]♦ времени)[/ex] проходить, пролетать:[/trn]
