set out
	[p]v adv[/p]
	[m1][trn]1 отправиться в дорогу:[/trn]
	\[[com]IØ (for, on) [/com]\] [ex]♦ He set out for work an hour ago, hadnt he arrived? The children were always excited to set out on a camping trip.[/ex]
	\[T4\] [ex]♦ All the villagers have set out looking for the missing child.[/ex] → go away (1), etc.
	[m1][trn]2 начать какую-л. деятельность, начать работать:[/trn]
