	[m1][trn]3 поправлять (кого-л.):[/trn]
	\[T1b\] [ex]♦ The firm sent me an incorrect bill, but I soon set them right. If I make a mistake when I read out the results, please set me right.[/ex] → put right (3), put straight (3), set straight (3)
	[m1][trn]4 улучшать (чье-л.) самочувствие; восстанавливать силы:[/trn]
	\[T1b\] [ex]♦ This medicine will quickly set you right after your illness.[/ex]
	
set straight
	[p]v adj[/p]
