	[m1][trn]2 исправлять (ошибки):[/trn]
	\[T1b\] [ex]♦ There were some mistaken notes in that last passage; let's set them straight now, before the performance. We must set the facts straight so that he isn't charged unfairly.[/ex] → put right (2), put straight (2), set right (3)
	[m1][trn]3 поправлять (кого-л.), указывать (кому-л.) па ошибку:[/trn]
