settle down
	[p]v adv[/p]
	[m1][trn]1 оседать; осаживать.[/trn]
	\[IØ + DOWN\] [ex]♦ The contents of the packet may settle down in travelling.[/ex] 
	\[T1 + DOWN\] [ex]♦ Shaking will settle the powder down.[/ex] → shake down (1)
	[m1][trn]2 устраивать(ся), усаживать(ся):[/trn]
	\[IØ + DOWN\] [ex]♦ I love to settle down in a deep armchair with a good book.[/ex]
	\[T1 + DOWN\] [ex]♦ Setting himself down in his favourite chair, he lit his pipe.[/ex]
	[m1][trn]3 [i] (о птице)[/i] усаживаться на землю:[/trn]
	\[IØ + DOWN) [ex]♦ The bird landed on the branch then settled down and folded its wings.[/ex]
	[m1][trn]4 [p] (о судне)[/p] тонуть:[/trn]
	\[IØ + DOWN\] [ex]♦ The damaged ship leaned over and slowly settled down on the ocean floor.[/ex]
	[m1][trn]5 устраивать(ся), обосновать(ся), поселить(ся):[/trn]
	\[IØ (in)\] [ex]♦ How long did it take you to settle down in this country?[/ex]
	\[T1 (m)\] [ex]♦ The organization aims to settle newcomers down in the city.[/ex]
	→ settle in1 (1), shake down (2)
	[m1][trn]6 остепенить(ся), осваиваться:[/trn] 
	\[IØ\] [ex]♦ Isn't it time that Jim got married and settled down? You'll soon settle down after a few days on the job.[/ex] 
	\[T1b\] [ex]♦ Having a baby often settles a young man and woman down.[/ex]
	[m1][trn]7 успокаивать(ся):[/trn]
	\[IØ\] [ex]♦ The marriage began in a stormy fashion, but soon settled down. I can't seem to settle down today; something must be worrying me. Has that noisy class settled down yet?[/ex]
	\[T1\] [ex]♦ Please go upstairs and settle the children down for me, they're restless again and won't sleep. That class needs a strong teacher to settle them down.[/ex]
	[m1][trn]8 прекратиться, улечься:[/trn]
	\[IØ\] [ex]♦ When all the excitement had settled down, it was clear that there had been no real cause for anxiety. Wait till the police hunt has settled down and then make your escape. The long struggle between the unions and the government may settle down into an uneasy peace.[/ex] → die down (2)
	[m1][trn]9 взяться за какое-л. дело, приниматься за работу:[/trn]
	\[IØ\] [ex]♦ I must settle down this morning and do the cleaning.[/ex]
	
