	\[T1\] [ex]♦ You can't interrupt the committee once they've settled down to dinner.[/ex]
	\[T4\] [ex]♦ I really must settle down to finishing the book, it's now urgent.[/ex]
	
settle for
	[m0][p]v prep[/p]
