	[m1][trn]брызгать, забрызгивать, разбрызгивать:[/trn]
	\[X9 + on/onto/over\] [ex]♦ He careful with that brush, you're spattering paint (all) over the floor.[/ex] 
	\[[com]L9 on/onto/over[/com]\] [ex]♦ There was a hole in the roof, and rainwater was spattering on our heads.[/ex]
	
