	→ talk of (3)
	[m1][trn]4 [b]speak of the devil[/b] [p]not fml[/p] лёгок на помине:[/trn] 
	[ex]♦ Speak of the devil—here she is![/ex] → talk of (4)
	[m1][trn]5 [b]speak ill/well of[/b] говорить плохо/хорошо (о ком-л. или чём-л.):[/trn]
	\[[com]usu. simple tenses[/com]\] [ex]♦ Do not speak ill of the dead.[/ex]
	[m1][trn]6 [b]no/nothing to speak of[/b] не о чем и говорить, не стоит и упоминать:[/trn]
	[ex]♦ It's been а pleasant winter, with no snow to speak of. There's no news, at least nothing to speak of.[/ex]
	
