	\[[com]T1 (often simple tenses)[/com]\] [ex]♦ Would any committee member care to speak to the question? I'm not prepared to speak to a title like that.[/ex]
	[m1][trn]5 поддерживать (чью-л. идею):[/trn]
	\[[com]T1 (often simple tenses)[/com]\] [ex]♦ Many members spoke to their friend's suggestion.[/ex]
	
