spin out
	[p]v adv[/p]
	[m1][trn]1 прясть:[/trn]
	\[T1 + OUT) [ex]♦ Her skilful fingers spun the wool out to a fine thread.[/ex]
	[m1][trn]2 [p]not fml[/p] растягивать (беседу, время, деньги):[/trn]
	\[Т11 [ex]♦ The broadcaster will have to spin out his talk to make it last the full half hour. How can I spin my money out till the end of the month? We would all like to spin out happy times and shorten bad days.[/ex]
