	[m1][trn]2 разбирать(ся) на части:[/trn]
	\[T1b\] [ex]♦ We had to take the whole engine apart to discover the cause of the trouble.[/ex]
	\[IØ (simple tenses)\] [ex]♦ Does this toy take apart so that the child can find out how it works?[/ex] 
	—take-apart [p]adj[/p] → pull apart (1), etc.
	[m1][trn]3 [p]not fml[/p] строго наказать (кого-л.), разбить (кого-л.) в пух и прах:[/trn]
