	[m1][trn]4 разнести (что-л.) в пух и прах:[/trn]
	\[Т1а\] [ex]♦ Tom's latest book has been taken apart by the newspapers. Don't take her performance apart as unkindly as you did last time, even if it is bad; it could destroy her.[/ex]
	→ pull apart (2), pull to2 (3), rend to (2), rip to (2). take to (7b), tear apart (3), tear to (2)
	[m1][trn]5 [p]not fml[/p] ругать (кого-л.), разнести (кого-л.) на части:[/trn]
