	[m1][trn]3 взять (кого-л.) на работу (в фирму):[/trn]
	\[D1\] [ex]♦ It's easy for you to find a fob when you know that your uncle will take you into the family firm.[/ex] → take in1 (5)
	[m1][trn]4 take something into account/consideration принять что-л. во внимание:[/trn]
