	[m1][trn]5 take a child into care отдать ребенка в приют и т. п.:[/trn]
	[ex]♦ Since the parents' sudden death in the accident, we have no choice but to take the children into care.[/ex]
	[m1][trn]6 take someone into one's confidence доверять кому-л. свои секреты:[/trn]
