	\[usu. simple tenses\] [ex]♦ Why did she take it into her head that I was to blame? I wasn't even there at the time![/ex] → get into (20)
	[m1][trn]8 take it into one's head to do something [p]not fml[/p] вбить себе в голову сделать что-л.:[/trn]
