take of
	[m0][p]v prep[/p]
	[m1][trn]1 take account of принимать (что-л. или кого-л.) в расчёт:[/trn]
	[ex]♦ Did you take account of the number of guests when you were planning the seating for the party? I took account of the time as we left the house.[/ex] → take into (4)
	[m1][trn]2 take advantage of использовать (что-л. или кого-л.) для своей выгоды, извлекать выгоду (из чего-л. или кого-л.):[/trn]
	[ex]♦ Such a skilled tennis player knows how to take advantage of his opponent's chief weakness. It's unfair to take advantage of your father's good nature. I think she's taking advantage of me, using me for her own gains.[/ex]
	[m1][trn]3 take care of:[/trn] 
	[m1][trn]а заботиться (о чём-л. или ком-л.):[/trn]
