	[m1][trn]2 затратить (время) на (какую-л. работу):[/trn]
	\[T1 + over\] [ex]♦ How long are you going to take over that simple little job? I have taken nearly three years over this book already.[/ex] → be over2 (3)
	[m1][trn]3 помогать (кому-л.) выучить, повторить, усвоить (что-л.):[/trn]
	\[D1\] [ex]♦ Will you take те over my lines? I have to learn them before tomorrow. The teacher will take the class over the answers to the test.[/ex] → go over2 (2), go through2 (7), look over2 (5), run over2 (5), run through2 (7), take through2 (2)
	[m1][trn]4 показывать (что-л. кому-л.), водить (кого-л.) по (дому, музею и т. п.):[/trn]
