	\[Х9 + over\] [ex]♦ Throw a warm cover over the sleeping child. If you do that again. I'll throw you over my knee and beat you. The soldiers can throw a bridge over the river in a few hours. Throw the rope over the hook and fasten it tight.[/ex]
