throw overboard
	[p]v adv[/p]
	[m1][trn]1 бросать (что-л. или кого-л.) через борт в воду:[/trn]
	\[Х9 + OVERBOARD\] [ex]♦ Do you mean to tell me that you just throw the kitchen waste overboard into the clean lake? The murderer knocked the man unconscious and threw him overboard, so that it would seem as if he simply drowned.[/ex]
	[m1][trn]2 отбросить (идеи, принципы и т. и.):[/trn]
