	[m1][trn]2 отдавать (что-л. кому-л.):[/trn]
	\[T1 + UP (usu. simple tenses)\] [ex]♦ The sea will never yield up its secrets. It's still polite to yield up your seat on the bus to an old lady.[/ex] → <<give up>> (8), etc.
	[m1][trn]3 [b]yield up the ghost[/b] умереть:[/trn]
